,"speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_7","text":"A few days ago, they were praising Missilis to the heavens!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_8","text":"Now they're changing your tune just because some attention whores spread a few rumors?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_9","text":"Technically speaking, it wasn't rumors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_10","text":"Nothing John Doe said was a lie.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_11","text":"Shut up. If I say it was rumors. it was rumors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_12","text":"Now then, have you found out John Doe's identity?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16af_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rian","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_16af_02_13","text":"No. Not yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_16a